subject_definitions:
@林听晚 is the young woman with a sharp V-shaped face, fine arched eyebrows, narrow phoenix eyes, matte red lips, a French high updo with loose strands, and round pearl earrings, wearing a white tweed jacket with crisp woven texture over a black satin slip dress with a soft pearlescent sheen, sheer black stockings, and black pointed stiletto heels.
@周砚 is the tall man with a square jaw, thick wild eyebrows, single-eyelid narrow eyes, and a black side-parted slicked-back short hairstyle, wearing a tailored black wool suit jacket with a matte finish over a crisp white cotton shirt, black straight wool trousers, and black matte leather dress shoes.
@乔芊 is the young woman with a heart-shaped face, soft curved eyebrows, round apricot eyes with light amber irises, peach-toned makeup, and a deep brown half-up hairstyle with air bangs, wearing a white cotton undershirt under a light pink lace A-line bridesmaid dress with hollow transparent patterns and soft draping fabric, and pink square-toe block-heel shoes.
@酒店宴会厅后台灯光间 is the indoor lighting room doorway space with a half-open glass door showing clear reflections, a warm white ceiling light above, and a bright corridor in the background providing spatial depth.
@手机 is the modern rectangular smartphone with a black slim body and a large high-definition glass screen displaying a video recording interface.
@戒指 is the delicate bright silver metal wedding ring with a shiny metallic luster.
@林听晚音色 is the voice-timbre reference for @林听晚 (S1).
@周砚音色 is the voice-timbre reference for @周砚 (S2).
@乔芊音色 is the voice-timbre reference for @乔芊 (S3).

summary:
[reference generation + audio reference] The target video shows @林听晚 standing at the doorway of @酒店宴会厅后台灯光间, holding @手机 to record and questioning @周砚, who panics and tries to explain while @乔芊 pulls her hand back with @戒指 on her finger. Across three shots, the sequence uses over-the-shoulder angles for the confrontation. @林听晚音色, @周砚音色, and @乔芊音色 are the voice references for the three speakers.

