detailed_description:
The target video is in a Chinese 3D-animated feature style rendered with physically based shading: high-density character models, crisp material textures on silk, leather, metal and skin, hair built from separated strand clusters, soft global illumination under one clearly directional key light, and a semi-realistic finish with realistic body proportions and no cartoon exaggeration.
[Shot 1] A medium close-up over-the-shoulder shot from behind @周砚's right shoulder. @林听晚 stands at the left side of the doorway of @酒店宴会厅后台灯光间, facing inward. She holds @手机 in her right hand, the screen displaying the recording interface. Her expression is cold and sharp, eyes narrowed, and the warm white ceiling light along with glass reflections illuminates her face and the crisp woven texture of her white tweed jacket. @周砚's black wool suit shoulder is blurred in the foreground. In the background, @周砚 turns his head toward the door with a panicked expression, and @乔芊 pulls her right hand back, her fingers still loosely holding @戒指. The camera holds a static shot. @林听晚 (S1) says at a measured, cold pace, her tone sharp and questioning: <d>[Chinese] 周砚，你给伴娘试戒指？</d>
[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a close-up over-the-shoulder from behind @林听晚's right shoulder. The foreground blurs her white tweed jacket. The focus is on @周砚's front face. His single-eyelid narrow eyes dart in panic, his brow furrowed, and his lips move rapidly as he tries to explain. The warm indoor light casts soft contact shadows on his square jaw, and the matte finish of his black wool suit stays crisp. @林听晚's back faces the camera, her lips sealed. The camera holds a static shot. @周砚 (S2) says at a fast, slightly trembling pace, his tone anxious and pleading: <d>[Chinese] 听晚，你听我解释。</d>
[Shot 3] At 00:06.500, the shot cuts to a close-up over-the-shoulder from behind @周砚's left shoulder. The foreground blurs his black suit shoulder. The focus is on @乔芊's side profile. Her round amber eyes are red and watery, a film of moisture gathering without spilling, and her lips part slightly as she speaks. Her right hand is still near her chest, fingers holding @戒指. The soft warm light highlights her peach-toned makeup, the separated strand clusters of her air bangs, and the hollow transparent lace patterns of her light pink bridesmaid dress. @林听晚 and @周砚 keep their lips sealed. The camera holds a static shot. @乔芊 (S3) says at a slow, trembling pace, her tone soft and aggrieved: <d>[Chinese] 晚晚，不是你想的那样。</d> From 00:09.500 to 00:10.000, all characters keep their lips sealed in a static hold.

overall_soundscape:
Distant muffled sound of a banquet hall host testing a microphone runs continuously beneath the scene, mixed with faint ambient room tone. The subtle rustle of fabric occurs as @乔芊 pulls her hand back, and the faint plastic click of @手机 being held steady is audible.

